# JOURNEY · the Ledger Nerve, the sense that reads money: over is cash above its threshold, so a fish
# wired to it is a low-balance lamp in reverse. Its panel walks by count:
# listens, drives, threshold, cash, tank_value, over, broke.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/grow-a-matrixtank.play
include scenes/buy-at-the-bench.play "Ledger Nerve" Senses
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish ledger
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish rich

run /consume ledger nerve
key enter
absent to the botfishes

run /program "Ledger"
key down 5
expect tank_value
type flush
snap the nerve raises flush while the purse is over its threshold
key enter
absent listens

run /program "Rich"
type flush
key enter

tick 3
run /circuit
key down
expect ●  Rich
snap what is left of the purse is still over a thousand, so Rich is lit
key esc
absent Circuit#
